<template>
  <section>
    <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">With the Router</h2>
    <p class="pdx-txt-small pdx-ink-muted">
      An entry with <code>href</code> is a plain link, and followed by the browser it loads the whole page.
      <code>pdx-select</code> is cancelable: prevent it and navigate with the router, and the menu stops the link.
      A Ctrl, Cmd or Shift click is left to the browser, so opening in a new tab still works.
    </p>
